    "body": "Spec-wise this is https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#topmost-clicked-popover which only checks `popovertarget`. Seems engines are checking `commandfor` target as well.\n\nI _think_ we need to specify the reverse of the \"implicit anchor element\" thing, right?",
