    "body": "Interesting behavior. I need to dig in more, but one thing that's interesting is that \"Foo 2\" only has `commandfor` but not `command` so that doesn't actually do anything on click. If you add `command=\"toggle-popover\"` then the two buttons behave the same. It seems odd that this would change the behavior.\n\nHere's an expanded set of tests, including that and also `popovertarget` (which also dismisses): https://jsbin.com/ciyeduj/edit?html,output",
